{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0125d32da961ae508b73466e7bdadf0ac1081629639d9b83fa58779a03735a90",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_a:2_4_007_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ed3d0a9cf912560207fb5b5f1dba7a3da9a6d761aed0f6cdf7f1c17c962dc38",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_a:2_4_007_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ebb05378c81697414e35d872c960cf7ed30037e9b7edb8d8f0a376fc28c98a6",
      "text": "刚才在事务所，他们让我看了\n制作完成的宣传海报。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_a:2_4_007_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9715fea601f5457645f677df763df5e9ff1d10df03ab36d711030215b6d59583",
      "text": "布景和服装的完成度，在拍摄时就已经\n让我非常吃惊了，不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_a:2_4_007_02_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbae0c99a777f58d180327803c8a75ae6ba2b704d28a8b0779a4e37b358228c8",
      "text": "像这样实际做成海报之后，\n感觉幽灵简直就像真的存在一样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_a:2_4_007_02_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a83fd85a4a6bf46b478ac191e3f6a998fdc2a9094240d006949a19676b304bf2",
      "text": "照片的另一头，仿佛能听到洋馆里响起的风声、\n以及扮演幽灵的大家的声音呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_a:2_4_007_02_09_a:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ddcf738209da8565571b2e0db32a9ef78bbf6c9eda706f1a0d7cd0727018081",
      "text": "听说入场人数\n增加了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_a:2_4_007_02_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3187fa972fd98e896d1a0431d5ca92dadae1e87548030f1c72d6b810c68e1b7",
      "text": "圭先生扮演的幽灵，\n好像广受好评呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_a:2_4_007_02_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea9e416a207012a1f6e290a6222179c1f0b099ca174866d050c6a54d88b5f7aa",
      "text": "这说明宣传成功了吧。和大家一起努力\n揣摩塑造角色总算没有白费。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_a:2_4_007_02_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e67b18a40f9c28f9455b0ec706bd8d528659ba95292ff7b61b342287cc8190e1",
      "text": "我试着尽量不做太出格的举动……\n难道那样反而刚好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_a:2_4_007_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78227696cd47ee74d286895c24181fd00cdd92c0e86897790152e15a1fcd54ac",
      "text": "看了海报来到鬼屋的人们，\n会有怎样的感觉呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_a:2_4_007_02_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:655a69084d79cbaf2d0d8e265adacaf0aa9347a10889ff706ee53efabb56144c",
      "text": "既然评价很好，想必一定在\n那个空间里玩得很开心吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_a:2_4_007_02_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3a4cf8c9b8bf058ba22fc113e6446fd2bfc47571f20e82fc976e67eba7de18a",
      "text": "这么聊着聊着，鬼屋里流淌的\n那种独特的声响，让我有点想念了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_402_2_4_007_02_09_a:2_4_007_02_09_a:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:267f1dd1debd232d3bc4dd0281c08bd2fb4b6254a3dd46adda14dade1e036119",
      "text": "要是还有机会去的话，我想要再次\n静下心来仔细倾听一番呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
